"kits": "id,name,instruction\r\nsmoke,Smokehouse,Smoked paprika + garlic + pepper going in. G Hughes BBQ to finish.\r\ntex,Tex-Mex,Chili powder + cumin + garlic. Salsa over the top.\r\ngb,Garlic butter,Granulated garlic + salt. Melted butter tossed through on the way out.\r\nlp,Lemon pepper,\"Lemon pepper, heavier than feels right. Olive oil to finish.\"\r\nbuff,Buffalo,Salt + garlic going in. Frank's RedHot with a little butter coming out.\r\nteri,Teriyaki,Salt going in. Brush G Hughes teriyaki the last 3 minutes.\r\nranch,Ranch,Ranch seasoning dusted on. Dip: Greek yogurt + more ranch seasoning.\r\nmont,Montreal,\"Montreal steak seasoning, both sides, generous. Butter while it rests.\"\r\ndeli,Deli style,Already seasoned — dijon or spicy mustard on the side.\r\ncajun,Cajun,\"Cajun or blackening seasoning, heavy. Squeeze of lemon at the end.\"\r\nsesame,Sesame-ginger,Soy sauce + ginger + garlic going in. Toasted sesame oil and sliced scallion to finish.\r\ncurry,Curry,Curry powder + garlic + ginger going in. A squeeze of lime at the end.\r\nmed,Mediterranean,Oregano + garlic + lemon zest going in. Olive oil and a squeeze of lemon coming out.\r\nsp,Salt and pepper,\"Coarse salt going in, black pepper coming out. Nothing else.\"\r\n",
