"regimens": "id,name,allows,excludes,red_meat_slots,fish_slots,beans_slots,unmoved_by,note\nomnivore,Everything,,,5,2,6,,Any meal in the catalog.\nno_vegetables,No vegetables,,vegetable,5,2,6,,\"Everything but vegetables. The catalog was built for this: five beef, two fish and six bean nights per 14-meal cycle.\"\npescatarian,Pescatarian,,beef|pork|poultry,0,8,6,,\"Fish and shellfish, no meat. Fish on eight nights, shellfish on the rest.\"\nvegetarian,Vegetarian,,beef|pork|poultry|fish|shellfish,0,0,8,,No meat or fish; eggs and dairy stay.\nvegan,Vegan,,beef|pork|poultry|fish|shellfish|dairy|egg,0,0,8,,Nothing from an animal.\nno_red_meat,No red meat,,beef,0,3,6,,\"Poultry, pork and fish; no beef.\"\nno_pork,No pork,,pork,5,2,6,,Everything but pork.\ndairy_free,Dairy-free,,dairy,5,2,6,,\"No milk, cheese or yogurt.\"\ncarnivore,Carnivore,beef|pork|poultry|fish|shellfish|egg|dairy,,7,3,0,apob|ldl_cholesterol|ferritin,\"Meat, fish, eggs and dairy only. Nothing from a plant. Unmoved by ApoB, LDL and ferritin: those are charted, and dinner stays.\"\nketo,Keto,,grain|potato|beans|fruit,5,3,0,apob|ldl_cholesterol,\"No grain, potato, beans or fruit. Unmoved by ApoB and LDL: those are charted, and dinner stays.\"\n",
